- "Sigh...as more and more people coming into Prontera,"
+ "Ai... com cada vez mais gente chegando a Prontera,"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#151 (mes)
- "better and better my business has become nowadays. But..."
+ "meu negócio vai cada vez melhor. Mas..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#152 (mes)
- "Well, I am having a hard time to keep a good stock of food ingredients."
+ "Bem, está difícil manter um bom estoque de ingredientes."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#153 (mes)
- "[Bartender]"
+ "[Barman]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#154 (mes)
- "As you see, the numbers of the monsters outside of town has been greatly increased and they have caused trouble to my suppliers to deliver the goods at a right time."
+ "Como vê, o número de monstros fora da cidade cresceu muito, e isso atrapalha meus fornecedores a entregar no prazo."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#155 (mes)
- "I cannot make my ultra nice menus with common ingredients because they are super special!"
+ "Não dá para fazer meus pratos ultra especiais com ingredientes comuns!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#156 (mes)
- "[Bartender]"
+ "[Barman]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#157 (mes)
- "So I have been contacting super heavy champion hunters for fresh and special ingredients."
+ "Por isso venho procurando caçadores campeões para trazer ingredientes frescos e especiais."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#158 (mes)
- "But the demand has exceeded the supply in these days."
+ "Mas a procura passou a oferta ultimamente."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#159 (mes)
- "[Bartender]"
+ "[Barman]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#160 (mes)
- "I can't keep my business busy without my special menu 'Crunch Crunch Sour' and 'Savory Yum Yum'...*Sigh*"
+ "Não consigo manter o movimento sem meus pratos 'Croc Croc Azedo' e 'Saboroso Nham Nham'...*Ai*"
