- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#175 (mes)
- "Hey, come on over and let's drink! I have lots of interesting stories to tell!"
+ "Ei, chega mais e vamos beber! Tenho muitas histórias interessantes!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#176 (mes)
- "I know lots of things about Prontera. I have seen many fine views and I also have explored some monster lairs around this city."
+ "Sei muita coisa sobre Prontera. Já vi paisagens lindas e explorei covis de monstros perto da cidade."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#177 (select)
- "How could you enter monster lairs?:Cancel"
+ "Como você entrou em covis de monstros?:Cancelar"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#178 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#179 (mes)
- "I may appear to be a drunken man but I am more than meets the eye."
+ "Posso parecer um bêbado, mas sou mais do que aparento."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#180 (mes)
- "Well, I happened to enter the places for carrying weapons for hunters or for delivering stuffs and whatsoever."
+ "Bom, eu entrava nesses lugares carregando armas para caçadores ou entregando coisas."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#181 (mes)
- "You might think of me as a mere delivery guy,"
+ "Você pode me achar um mero entregador,"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#182 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#183 (mes)
- "But I am very proud of my job. You know how tough the world has become?"
+ "mas tenho muito orgulho do meu trabalho. Sabe como o mundo ficou difícil?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#184 (mes)
- "No matter how hard a work is, I am not afraid of doing that."
+ "Por mais duro que seja o trabalho, não tenho medo de fazer."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#185 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#186 (mes)
- "Anyways, that is how I have explored some strange places like monster lairs..."
+ "Enfim, foi assim que explorei uns lugares estranhos, como covis de monstros..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#187 (mes)
- "That is also a reason why I keep my job."
+ "É também por isso que continuo no emprego."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#188 (mes)
- "Ah, I just recall being inside the maze and the spooky forest!"
+ "Ah, acabei de lembrar do labirinto e da floresta assombrada!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#189 (select)
- "The Maze?:The Spooky Forest?:Cancel"
+ "O labirinto?:A floresta assombrada?:Cancelar"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#190 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#191 (mes)
- "Yes. Few days ago, I have entered a mysterious maze following a group of hunters at the north of Prontera."
+ "Sim. Dias atrás entrei num labirinto misterioso ao norte de Prontera, seguindo um grupo de caçadores."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#192 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#193 (mes)
- "They said that they could get lots and lots of rare items from the maze even if the maze was filled with awfully strong monsters."
+ "Diziam que dava para tirar de lá muitos itens raros, mesmo o labirinto estando cheio de monstros fortíssimos."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#194 (mes)
- "So we went there but as soon as we entered, we were just stuck inside the maze, you know."
+ "Fomos até lá, mas assim que entramos ficamos presos dentro do labirinto."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#195 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#196 (mes)
- "We were just circling around and then we decided to leave the place. That was one hell of the maze."
+ "Ficamos andando em círculos e resolvemos sair. Aquilo era um labirinto dos infernos."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#197 (mes)
- "But I made up my mind that I would successfully explore the maze one day."
+ "Mas decidi que um dia vou explorar aquele labirinto até o fim."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#198 (select)
- "How can I get there?:Cancel"
+ "Como chego lá?:Cancelar"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#199 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#200 (mes)
- "Err? Haven't you still toured the outside of Prontera?"
+ "Ãh? Você ainda não deu uma volta fora de Prontera?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#201 (mes)
- "The maze can be found inside a forest at the north of Prontera. Go check the north west side of the forest."
+ "O labirinto fica dentro de uma floresta ao norte de Prontera. Procure no lado noroeste da floresta."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#202 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#203 (mes)
- "Yeap, be careful when you adventure alone~"
+ "É isso, tome cuidado ao se aventurar sozinho~"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#204 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#205 (mes)
- "When you go outside of Prontera heading to north east, you will arrive at the peaceful ruins. I have been there a while ago, to deliver something to a priest."
+ "Saindo de Prontera para nordeste você chega às ruínas tranquilas. Estive lá faz um tempo, entregando algo a um sacerdote."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#206 (mes)
- "I had to pass a forest on the way to the ruins, and the forest was filled with monkeys and raccoons."
+ "Tive que atravessar uma floresta no caminho, e ela estava cheia de macacos e guaxinins."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#207 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#208 (mes)
- "Be forewarned that the forest is not a place to go on a picnic. If you drop something on the ground, the monkeys come out from nowhere and take away all of your possessions."
+ "Fica o aviso: a floresta não é lugar de piquenique. Se você deixar algo cair, os macacos aparecem do nada e levam tudo."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#209 (select)
- "How can I get there?:Cancel"
+ "Como chego lá?:Cancelar"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#210 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#211 (mes)
- "There is no road directly leads to the ruins. But if you go north and keep heading to east, you will get there."
+ "Não há estrada direta para as ruínas. Mas indo ao norte e seguindo para leste você chega."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#212 (mes)
- "Oh, be careful on your way to the ruins because there are some weird plant things that assault passersby for no reason."
+ "Ah, cuidado no caminho: há umas plantas esquisitas que atacam quem passa sem motivo nenhum."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#213 (mes)
- "[Shevild]"
+ "[Shevild]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#214 (mes)
- "Yeap, be careful when you adventure alone~"
+ "É isso, tome cuidado ao se aventurar sozinho~"
