+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#220 (mes)
- "What...?"
+ "O quê...?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#221 (mes)
- "Sick and tired of killing monsters on fields and in dungeons already? Come on..."
+ "Já cansou de matar monstro em campo e masmorra? Qual é..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#222 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#223 (mes)
- "Hahaha, it seems you're pretty confident of your strength, huh? Hmm... Why don't you go join a guild? I mean, all the tough guys are going it."
+ "Hahaha, parece que você confia na própria força, hein? Hmm... Por que não entra num clã? Os brutamontes todos estão fazendo isso."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#224 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#225 (mes)
- "Personally though, I don't know any guilds, so you'll have to ask around. Make some contacts, connections, you know, networking."
+ "Pessoalmente eu não conheço clã nenhum, então vai ter que perguntar por aí. Faça contatos, conexões, sabe como é."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#226 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#227 (mes)
- "I don't even know if you don't like taking orders, but if that's the case, why don't you make your own guild?"
+ "Não sei se você não gosta de receber ordens, mas se for o caso, por que não cria o seu próprio clã?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#228 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#229 (mes)
- "One time I walked all the way to Al de Baran, instead of taking a warp. It was pretty dangerous with all those monsters!"
+ "Uma vez fui a pé até Al De Baran, em vez de usar portal. Foi bem perigoso com todos aqueles monstros!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#230 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#231 (mes)
- "I almost died! Some of those monsters just kept following me and trying to kill me, even though I did nothing to them! It was pretty crazy."
+ "Quase morri! Alguns monstros ficavam me seguindo e tentando me matar, mesmo eu não tendo feito nada! Foi uma loucura."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#232 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#233 (mes)
- "Well, still, I feel that taking the scenic route was worth it. There were some pretty magnificent sights on the way."
+ "Mesmo assim, valeu a pena ir pelo caminho panorâmico. Havia paisagens magníficas no percurso."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#234 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#235 (mes)
- "Even the city of Al de Baran is a splendid vision to the eyes, with its elegant architecture and romantic canal."
+ "A própria cidade de Al De Baran é um espetáculo, com a arquitetura elegante e o canal romântico."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#236 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#237 (mes)
- "The headquarters of Kafra Corporation is also located in Al de Baran. You should really stop by and check it out for yourself."
+ "A sede da Corporação Kafra também fica em Al De Baran. Vale muito a pena dar uma passada e ver."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#238 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#239 (mes)
- "The kingdom of"
+ "O reino de"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#240 (mes)
- "Rune-Midgarts is ruled"
+ "Rune-Midgard é governado"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#241 (mes)
- "by kind and benevolent"
+ "pelo gentil e benevolente"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#242 (mes)
- "King Tristram III."
+ "Rei Tristram III."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#243 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#244 (mes)
- "We really owe the prosperity of Rune-Midgarts to him. He was able to convince the people to welcome outsiders into Prontera, as well as establish trade to foreign lands, like Amatsu and Kunlun."
+ "Devemos a ele a prosperidade de Rune-Midgard. Ele convenceu o povo a receber forasteiros em Prontera e estabeleceu comércio com terras distantes, como Amatsu e Kunlun."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#245 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#246 (mes)
- "But sometimes..."
+ "Mas às vezes..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#247 (mes)
- "It can be hard to believe he's such a brilliant and capable leader."
+ "é difícil acreditar que ele seja um líder tão brilhante e capaz."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#248 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#249 (mes)
- "After all, the only time I see him is when he's conducting weddings. Even if a wedding isn't going on, he's still kind of loitering around the Prontera church!"
+ "Afinal, só o vejo quando está celebrando casamento. E mesmo sem casamento ele fica rondando a igreja de Prontera!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#250 (mes)
- "[TenSue]"
+ "[TenSue]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#251 (mes)
- "But..."
+ "Mas..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#252 (mes)
- "I guess you can get away with a lot of things when you happen to be lord and ruler of an entire nation."
+ "Acho que dá para relevar muita coisa quando se é senhor e governante de uma nação inteira."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#253 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#254 (mes)
- "Whether it's schmoozing with a member of the opposite sex, or battling monsters, I gotta say, it's all about ^333399skills^000000."
+ "Seja para conquistar alguém do sexo oposto ou para enfrentar monstros, tudo se resume a ^333399habilidades^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#255 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#256 (mes)
- "I can't help you much when it comes to the subject of talking to attractive women such as myself, but I can tell you a little more about skills that help in battle."
+ "Não posso ajudar muito no assunto de conversar com mulheres atraentes como eu, mas posso falar das habilidades que ajudam em batalha."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#257 (mes)
- "I don't really have any advice for skills when it comes to talking to a cute guy, but I can let you in on what I know about skills that help in battle."
+ "Não tenho conselho de habilidade para conversar com rapazes bonitos, mas posso contar o que sei das que ajudam em batalha."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#258 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#259 (mes)
- "For most skills, the maximum level is level 10. It's easy to stress yourself out, since it takes so many points to completely master a skill. What skills should you choose?!"
+ "A maioria das habilidades vai até o nível 10. Dá aflição, porque são muitos pontos para dominar uma só. Quais escolher?!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#260 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#261 (mes)
- "After all, if you spend too many skill points on one skill, you might not be able to learn another. That's right, there's a limit to the number of total skill points you can earn."
+ "Afinal, se gastar pontos demais numa habilidade, pode não conseguir aprender outra. Isso mesmo: há um limite de pontos que se pode ganhar."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#262 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#263 (mes)
- "But you know what? Not every skill is mastered at level 10. You can master some skills at only level 5. And even better, some skills are already mastered at level 1 or 2."
+ "Mas sabe de uma coisa? Nem toda habilidade se domina no nível 10. Algumas se dominam no 5. E melhor ainda: algumas já vêm dominadas no nível 1 ou 2."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#264 (mes)
- "[Marvin]"
+ "[Marvin]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#265 (mes)
- "So relax and plan ahead, so you can master all the skills that you really want to master the most. Also, don't just put skill points into anything. Remember to use your skill points wisely."
+ "Então relaxe e planeje, para dominar as habilidades que realmente importam. E não distribua pontos a esmo: use com sabedoria."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#266 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#267 (mes)
- "11..."
+ "11..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#268 (mes)
- "12..."
+ "12..."
