#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#270 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#271 (mes)
- "Oh! I didn't realize I had a guest. How may I help you?"
+ "Oh! Não vi que tinha visita. Em que posso ajudar?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#272 (select)
- "Talk:Dye Clothing:Cancel"
+ "Conversar:Tingir roupa:Cancelar"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#273 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#274 (mes)
- "Life may have gotten a little better, but receiving all these orders? *Whew!* Young ladies these days must be very well off, so my services may no longer be a luxury."
+ "A vida até melhorou um pouco, mas tantos pedidos assim? *Ufa!* As moças de hoje devem estar bem de vida, então meu serviço já não é luxo."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#275 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#276 (mes)
- "Well, people like them probably further the pursuit of beauty and fashion. But, of course, that's only my opinion."
+ "Bom, gente assim deve impulsionar a busca por beleza e moda. Mas isso é só a minha opinião."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#277 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#278 (mes)
- "I believe for us humans, clothes are one of the few ways to show our personality, style, and beauty."
+ "Acredito que, para nós humanos, a roupa é uma das poucas formas de mostrar personalidade, estilo e beleza."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#279 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#280 (mes)
- "Considering this, I personally think my job is very helpful and rather fancy. This in itself makes it all worthwhile. Coarse fabric and rough leather burst with energy and life when colored..."
+ "Por isso considero meu ofício útil e até refinado. Só isso já vale a pena. Tecido grosseiro e couro bruto ganham energia e vida quando ganham cor..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#281 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#282 (mes)
- "It is a very hard and tedious process, but the happiness and delight you feel when your clothes are done makes up for all the hard work."
+ "É um processo duro e tedioso, mas a alegria de ver a roupa pronta compensa todo o esforço."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#283 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#284 (mes)
- "Ah...!"
+ "Ah...!"
