- "You came to dye"
+ "Você veio tingir"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#286 (mes)
- "your clothes as well."
+ "sua roupa também."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#287 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#288 (mes)
- "But... I'm so sorry."
+ "Mas... sinto muito."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#289 (mes)
- "I don't have enough time to dye your clothes right now. I have so many orders that are still waiting to be done."
+ "Não tenho tempo para tingir sua roupa agora. Tenho pedidos demais na fila."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#290 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#291 (mes)
- "I'm sorry for the inconvenience, but could you come back again next time?"
+ "Desculpe o transtorno, mas você poderia voltar outra hora?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#292 (mes)
- "[Tailor Ginedin Rephere]"
+ "[Alfaiate Ginedin Rephere]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#293 (mes)
- "Feel free to take your time and relax here. I apologize that I have nothing to serve you, though."
+ "Fique à vontade e descanse aqui. Desculpe não ter nada para lhe oferecer."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#294 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#295 (mes)
- "Hello there~"
+ "Olá~"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#296 (mes)
- "Are you interested in learning more about helping and supporting other people?"
+ "Tem interesse em aprender mais sobre ajudar e apoiar os outros?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#297 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#298 (mes)
- "The Acolytes and Priests trained in this church can heal people, cure them of certain conditions, and even awaken the battle potential of other adventurers."
+ "Os Noviços e Sacerdotes formados nesta igreja curam pessoas, tratam certas condições e até despertam o potencial de combate de outros aventureiros."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#299 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#300 (mes)
- "Go and ahead and ask if you have any questions about skills for Acolytes and Priests."
+ "Pergunte à vontade se tiver dúvidas sobre habilidades de Noviço e Sacerdote."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#301 (select)
- "About Heal:About Cure:About Increase AGI:About Angelus:About Blessing:About Warp Portal:End Conversation"
+ "Sobre Curar:Sobre Medicar:Sobre Aumentar Agilidade:Sobre Angelus:Sobre Bênção:Sobre Portal:Encerrar conversa"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#302 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#303 (mes)
- "You can recover your own HP with the ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill. Healing is one of the most important ways you can help your friends in battle."
+ "Você recupera o próprio HP com ^6666CCCurar^000000. Curar é uma das formas mais importantes de ajudar os amigos em batalha."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#304 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#305 (mes)
- "Even though our powers are usually used to heal others, you can actually use the ^6666CCHeal^000000 skill to hurt Undead monsters."
+ "Embora nosso poder normalmente sirva para curar, dá para usar ^6666CCCurar^000000 para ferir monstros Mortos-Vivos."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#306 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#307 (mes)
- "Just remember to hold down the ^6666CCShift^000000 key when you use Cure or Heal on Undead monsters. Just be sure to hurt the monsters though, and don't use it to help monsters."
+ "Lembre-se de segurar ^6666CCShift^000000 ao usar Medicar ou Curar em Mortos-Vivos. E use para ferir o monstro, nunca para ajudá-lo."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#308 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#309 (mes)
- "Later, if you've learned ^6666CCHeal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCSanctuary^000000 if you become a Priest."
+ "Mais adiante, tendo aprendido ^6666CCCurar^000000 como Noviço, você poderá aprender ^6666CCSantuário^000000 ao virar Sacerdote."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#310 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#311 (mes)
- "Priests use ^6666CCSantuary^000000 to create an area which will restore the HP of you and your friends if you rest within the Sanctuary's area."
+ "Sacerdotes usam ^6666CCSantuário^000000 para criar uma área que restaura o HP de você e dos amigos que ficarem dentro dela."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#312 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#313 (mes)
- "Once you reach ^6666CCLevel 2 Heal^000000 as an Acolyte, you can learn ^6666CCCure^000000, which can be used to treat abnormal statuses."
+ "Ao chegar em ^6666CCCurar nível 2^000000 como Noviço, você pode aprender ^6666CCMedicar^000000, que trata condições anormais."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#314 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#315 (mes)
- "This skill can be such a life saver, since almost every abnormal status can be cured with the Cure skill. Just remember that you need ^6666CCLevel 2 Heal^000000 before you can learn Cure."
+ "Essa habilidade salva vidas, já que quase toda condição anormal se resolve com Medicar. Lembre que é preciso ^6666CCCurar nível 2^000000 antes."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#316 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#317 (mes)
- "Now, the ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000 skill can be used on you or your friends. For a while your AGI stat is increased, making you attack faster and dodge monster attacks more easily."
+ "Já ^6666CCAumentar Agilidade^000000 serve para você ou para os amigos. Por um tempo a AGI sobe, aumentando a velocidade de ataque e a esquiva."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#318 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#319 (mes)
- "If you're an Acolyte that wants to learn ^6666CCIncrease AGI^000000, you need to learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Heal^000000 first."
+ "Se você é Noviço e quer aprender ^6666CCAumentar Agilidade^000000, precisa de ^6666CCCurar nível 3^000000 antes."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#320 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#321 (mes)
- "You can use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 to increase your Defense, as well as the Defense of other party members. Remember though, you can only use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 on other people if they are in your party."
+ "Use ^6666CCAngelus^000000 para aumentar sua Defesa e a dos membros do grupo. Lembre: só funciona nos outros se estiverem no seu grupo."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#322 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#323 (mes)
- "Before you can learn Angelus, you will need to have ^6666CCLevel 3 Divine Protection^000000."
+ "Para aprender Angelus é preciso ter ^6666CCProteção Divina nível 3^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#324 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#325 (mes)
- "Also, if you keep learning Angelus, you'll eventually be able to learn ^6666CCKyrie Eleison^000000. That skill helps you evade initial attacks automatically."
+ "E, continuando com Angelus, você acaba podendo aprender ^6666CCKyrie Eleison^000000, que bloqueia ataques automaticamente."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#326 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#327 (mes)
- "^6666CCBlessing^000000 temporarily increases STR, DEX and INT. This skill will give you and your friends a great advantage in battle!"
+ "^6666CCBênção^000000 aumenta temporariamente FOR, DES e INT. Dá uma grande vantagem em batalha para você e seus amigos!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#328 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#329 (mes)
- "Before you can learn Blessing, you must first learn ^6666CCLevel 5 Divine Protection^000000."
+ "Para aprender Bênção é preciso ter ^6666CCProteção Divina nível 5^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#330 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#331 (mes)
- "^6666CCWarp Portal^000000 is a pretty complex skill, and you need to know some other skills before you can learn it."
+ "^6666CCPortal^000000 é uma habilidade complexa, e exige outras habilidades antes."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#332 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#333 (mes)
- "First, you need to learn ^6666CCRuwach^000000 which lets you see invisible monsters. After Ruwach, you will need to learn the ^6666CCTeleport^000000 skill."
+ "Primeiro é preciso ^6666CCRevelação^000000, que revela monstros invisíveis. Depois dela, ^6666CCTeleporte^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#334 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#335 (mes)
- "Once you learn ^6666CCWarp Portal^000000, the level of the Warp Portal skill will determine how many warp destinations, or Warp Points, you can memorize."
+ "Aprendido o ^6666CCPortal^000000, o nível dele determina quantos destinos você pode memorizar."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#336 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#337 (mes)
- "If you master the Warp Portal skill, you can have a maximum of 4 different Warp Points. But at least one Warp Point is designated as the Save Point that you've made with a Kafra Employee."
+ "Dominando o Portal, você pode ter até 4 destinos. Mas um deles é sempre o ponto de retorno que você salvou com uma Funcionária Kafra."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#338 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#339 (mes)
- "Well, it's a bit of hassle, but if you want to make a certain place one of your Warp Points, you need to be physically there first. Then, type in ^6666CC/memo^000000 into the command prompt."
+ "Dá um certo trabalho: para memorizar um lugar, é preciso estar fisicamente nele e digitar ^6666CC/memo^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#340 (mes)
- "[Garnet]"
+ "[Garnet]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#341 (mes)
- "Just so you know, you can't save a Warp Point inside of a dungeon. Oh, and don't forget, each time you make a Warp Portal, you must use 1 ^6666CCBlue Gemstone^000000 as a Catalyst."
+ "Só para constar: não dá para memorizar dentro de masmorra. E não esqueça: cada Portal consome 1 ^6666CCGema Azul^000000 como catalisador."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#342 (mes)
- "["
+ ""
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#343 (mes)
- "]"
+ ""
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#344 (mes)
- "Alright, I've"
+ "Certo, já"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#345 (mes)
- "heard enough."
+ "ouvi o bastante."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#346 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#347 (mes)
- "We Priests and Acolytes are not only limited to easing the suffering of our fellow man..."
+ "Nós, Sacerdotes e Noviços, não nos limitamos a aliviar o sofrimento do próximo..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#348 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#349 (mes)
- "We also mete swift and merciless punishment to the forces of evil. Well, purifying any poor souls that may have been turned into the Undead is also another duty."
+ "Também aplicamos punição rápida e implacável às forças do mal. E purificar as pobres almas transformadas em Mortos-Vivos é outro dever nosso."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#350 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#351 (mes)
- "Did you have any questions about Acolyte and Priest skills?"
+ "Tem alguma dúvida sobre habilidades de Noviço e Sacerdote?"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#352 (select)
- "About Divine Protection:About Demon Bane:About Decrease AGI:About Signum Crusis :About Pneuma:About Ruwach:About Teleport:End conversation."
+ "Sobre Proteção Divina:Sobre Flagelo do Mal:Sobre Diminuir Agilidade:Sobre Signum Crusis:Sobre Escudo Sagrado:Sobre Revelação:Sobre Teleporte:Encerrar conversa."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#353 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#354 (mes)
- "If you want to permanently improve your Defense against the Undead, learn ^6666CCDivine Protection^000000."
+ "Para aumentar permanentemente sua Defesa contra Mortos-Vivos, aprenda ^6666CCProteção Divina^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#355 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#356 (mes)
- "Learning Divine Protection to certain levels will also allow you to learn other skills, like ^6666CCAngelus^000000 and ^6666CCBlessing^000000, which Garnet can explain."
+ "Subir Proteção Divina também libera outras habilidades, como ^6666CCAngelus^000000 e ^6666CCBênção^000000, que a Garnet explica."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#357 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#358 (mes)
- "When you learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Divine Protection^000000, you will then be able to learn the ^6666CCDemon Bane^000000 skill."
+ "Com ^6666CCProteção Divina nível 3^000000 você poderá aprender ^6666CCFlagelo do Mal^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#359 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#360 (mes)
- "With ^6666CCDemon Bane^000000, the damage of your attacks against the Undead will be increased. Permanently."
+ "Com ^6666CCFlagelo do Mal^000000, o dano dos seus ataques contra Mortos-Vivos aumenta. Permanentemente."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#361 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#362 (mes)
- "^6666CCDemon Bane^000000 increases the damage you will inflict upon the Undead. Permanently."
+ "^6666CCFlagelo do Mal^000000 aumenta o dano que você causa em Mortos-Vivos. Permanentemente."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#363 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#364 (mes)
- "First, you'll need to learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Divine Protection^000000 to be able to learn Demon Bane, so keep that in mind."
+ "Primeiro é preciso ^6666CCProteção Divina nível 3^000000 para aprender Flagelo do Mal. Tenha isso em mente."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#365 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#366 (mes)
- "When you learn ^6666CCLevel 3 Demon Bane^000000, you will be able to learn ^6666CCSignum Crusis^000000, which lowers the Defense of Undead monsters, as well as monsters with the Dark property."
+ "Com ^6666CCFlagelo do Mal nível 3^000000 você poderá aprender ^6666CCSignum Crusis^000000, que reduz a Defesa de Mortos-Vivos e de monstros de propriedade Sombria."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#367 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#368 (mes)
- "Using ^6666CCDecrease AGI^000000 on monsters will slow their movement, attack speed, and the rate at which they can evade your own attacks. That way, you can maim them properly."
+ "Usar ^6666CCDiminuir Agilidade^000000 nos monstros reduz o movimento, a velocidade de ataque e a esquiva deles. Assim dá para castigá-los direito."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#369 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#370 (mes)
- "Remember, you must first learn ^6666CCLevel 2 Increase AGI^000000 if you want to be able to learn the Decrease AGI skill."
+ "Lembre-se: é preciso ^6666CCAumentar Agilidade nível 2^000000 antes de aprender Diminuir Agilidade."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#371 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#372 (mes)
- "The ^6666CCSignum Crusis^000000 skill lowers the Defense of monsters with the Undead or Dark properties. It has a wide range and can be quite powerful."
+ "^6666CCSignum Crusis^000000 reduz a Defesa de monstros Mortos-Vivos ou Sombrios. Tem alcance largo e pode ser bem poderosa."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#373 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#374 (mes)
- "However, it's a very difficult skill to use, and it has a relatively low success rate. But, do not despair if this skill is not successful all the time."
+ "Porém é difícil de usar e tem taxa de sucesso baixa. Não se desespere se nem sempre funcionar."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#375 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#376 (mes)
- "When it does work, it will give you a great battle advantage. Remember, you will ^6666CCLevel 3 Demon Bane^000000 to acquire this skill."
+ "Quando funciona, dá uma enorme vantagem. Lembre-se: exige ^6666CCFlagelo do Mal nível 3^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#377 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#378 (mes)
- "The ^6666CCPneuma^000000 allows you to generate a barrier that will block all long-range attacks in a certain range, creating a zone that will protect you from monsters that attack from a distance."
+ "^6666CCEscudo Sagrado^000000 cria uma barreira que bloqueia ataques à distância numa área, protegendo você de monstros que atacam de longe."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#379 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#380 (mes)
- "In order to become ready to learn Pneuma, you must first completely master the ^6666CCWarp Portal^000000 skill."
+ "Para aprender Escudo Sagrado é preciso dominar completamente o ^6666CCPortal^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#381 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#382 (mes)
- "Nothing can escape the eyes of the Holy! ^6666CCRuwach^000000 allows you to see monsters, as well as other adventurers, that are hidden or invisible."
+ "Nada escapa aos olhos do Sagrado! ^6666CCRevelação^000000 permite ver monstros e aventureiros escondidos ou invisíveis."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#383 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#384 (mes)
- "Once you learn Ruwach, you will be able to learn the ^6666CCTeleport^000000 skill."
+ "Aprendida a Revelação, você poderá aprender ^6666CCTeleporte^000000."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#385 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#386 (mes)
- "First, you must learn the ^6666CCRuwach^000000 skill in order to learn how to Teleport."
+ "Primeiro é preciso aprender ^6666CCRevelação^000000 para depois aprender o Teleporte."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#387 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#388 (mes)
- "The ^6666CCTeleport^000000 skill teleports you to a random location in the field or city which you are currently in. Teleport will prove useful for quick escapes, but where you may end up is... unpredictable."
+ "^6666CCTeleporte^000000 leva você a um ponto aleatório do campo ou cidade em que está. É útil para fugir rápido, mas onde você vai parar é... imprevisível."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#389 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#390 (mes)
- "Once the Teleport skill is mastered, you can Teleport to the latest Save Point that you have made with a Kafra Employee. I do not know why it is that way, but the Lord works in mysterious ways."
+ "Dominado o Teleporte, você pode ir ao último ponto de retorno salvo com uma Funcionária Kafra. Não sei por que é assim, mas os desígnios do Senhor são insondáveis."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#391 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#392 (mes)
- "When Teleport is mastered, you can also learn the ^6666CCWarp Portal^000000 skill. Ask Garnet if you wish to know more about Warp Portal."
+ "Dominado o Teleporte, você também pode aprender ^6666CCPortal^000000. Pergunte à Garnet se quiser saber mais."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#393 (mes)
- "[Henson]"
+ "[Henson]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#394 (mes)
- "If you wish to understand more about an Acolyte or Priest skill, you are welcome to visit me at any time."
+ "Se quiser entender melhor alguma habilidade de Noviço ou Sacerdote, apareça quando quiser."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#395 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#396 (mes)
- "H-hey!"
+ "E-ei!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#397 (mes)
- "What are"
+ "O que você"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#398 (mes)
- "you doing here?!"
+ "está fazendo aqui?!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#399 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#400 (mes)
- "Don't you know there's a Demon living in this forest?! I can't guarantee your safety"
+ "Não sabe que mora um Demônio nesta floresta?! Não posso garantir sua segurança"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#401 (mes)
- "if you go in!"
+ "se você entrar!"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#402 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#403 (mes)
- "*Sigh...* The last guy that entered this place haven't come back at all. He didn't listen to me and went in to gather Herbs or something dumb like that..."
+ "*Ai...* O último que entrou aqui nunca mais voltou. Não me deu ouvidos e foi colher Ervas ou alguma bobagem assim..."
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#404 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/prontera.txt#405 (mes)
- "Whaaaat a stupid guy. Why would anyone want to throw his life away just to collect some silly Herbs?"
+ "Que suuuujeito burro. Quem joga a vida fora só para colher umas Ervas bobas?"

