#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#18 (mes)
- "Izlude welcomes you."
+ "Izlude lhe dá as boas-vindas."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Bonne]"
+ "[Bonne]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#20 (mes)
- "Izlude is the satellite city of Prontera, capital of the Rune-Midgarts kingdom."
+ "Izlude é a cidade-satélite de Prontera, capital do reino de Rune-Midgard."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#21 (mes)
- "[Bonne]"
+ "[Bonne]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#22 (mes)
- "Izlude is key to our kingdom because of the Swordsman Association located here, as well as the fact that Izlude is in charge of protecting the Rune-Midgarts coastline."
+ "Izlude é essencial para o reino por causa da Associação dos Espadachins e por ser responsável por proteger o litoral de Rune-Midgard."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#23 (mes)
- "[Bonne]"
+ "[Bonne]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#24 (mes)
- "I know, this bridge might look weak and fragile, but it is actually state of the art, built with the most sophisticated technology."
+ "Eu sei, esta ponte parece frágil, mas na verdade é de ponta, construída com a tecnologia mais sofisticada."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#25 (mes)
- "[Bonne]"
+ "[Bonne]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#26 (mes)
- "No matter how strong storms may be, or how many people may stand on it, this bridge will NEEEEVER collapse."
+ "Por mais forte que seja a tempestade, ou por mais gente que fique em cima, esta ponte NUUUUNCA vai cair."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#27 (mes)
- "[Bonne]"
+ "[Bonne]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#28 (mes)
- "Please enjoy"
+ "Aproveite"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#29 (mes)
- "your visit"
+ "sua visita"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#30 (mes)
- "here in Izlude."
+ "aqui em Izlude."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#32 (mes)
- "Some people may think Izlude is just a satellite city of Prontera, and not really that important..."
+ "Tem gente que acha Izlude só uma cidade-satélite de Prontera, sem grande importância..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#33 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#34 (mes)
- "But Izlude is a beautiful town right next to the ocean, as well as beautiful Byalan Island."
+ "Mas Izlude é uma cidade linda à beira-mar, e ainda tem a bela Ilha Byalan."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#35 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#36 (mes)
- "You'll have to board on a ship at the port to get to Byalan Island. There are dangerous dungeons on that island, so don't go snooping around just anywhere."
+ "Você precisa embarcar no porto para chegar à Ilha Byalan. Há masmorras perigosas lá, então não saia bisbilhotando por aí."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#37 (mes)
- "Though it is very beautiful, Byalan Island has a mysterious dungeon that extends deep under the sea."
+ "Apesar de belíssima, a Ilha Byalan guarda uma masmorra misteriosa que desce até o fundo do mar."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#38 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#39 (mes)
- "People who've actually been there have said that if you go deep enough, the dungeon actually descends underwater."
+ "Quem já esteve lá diz que, descendo fundo o bastante, a masmorra continua debaixo d'água."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#40 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#41 (mes)
- "Surprisingly, once you're underwater, you can breathe just like a fish. Maybe some kind of supernatural force is in effect."
+ "Por incrível que pareça, debaixo d'água você respira como um peixe. Deve haver alguma força sobrenatural ali."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#42 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#43 (mes)
- "Ah..."
+ "Ah..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#44 (mes)
- "The people who've seen the underwater view say it is so fantastic that they've kept dreaming of it ever since."
+ "Quem viu a paisagem submarina diz que é tão fantástica que passou a sonhar com ela desde então."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#45 (mes)
- "[Charfri]"
+ "[Charfri]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#46 (mes)
- "But unfortunately, the monsters are too strong for ordinary people to merely go sightseeing there. Still, just once, I'd like to go down there..."
+ "Infelizmente os monstros são fortes demais para gente comum ir só passear. Ainda assim, eu queria descer lá pelo menos uma vez..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#47 (mes)
- "[Cuskoal]"
+ "[Cuskoal]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#48 (mes)
- "The Arena here is THE place for capable young people from all over the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom to challenge themselves and test their skills."
+ "A Arena daqui é O lugar onde os jovens capazes de todo o Reino de Rune-Midgard se desafiam e testam suas habilidades."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#49 (mes)
- "[Cuskoal]"
+ "[Cuskoal]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#50 (mes)
- "You can battle with monsters of differing levels. So, the number of stages you survive will be a testament to your battle prowess."
+ "Você enfrenta monstros de níveis variados. O número de estágios que sobreviver é a medida da sua capacidade de combate."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#51 (mes)
- "[Cuskoal]"
+ "[Cuskoal]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#52 (mes)
- "So, whaddya say?"
+ "E aí, o que me diz?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#53 (mes)
- "The pubs in Prontera are always full of people from local areas and from out-of-town. It can get pretty busy."
+ "As tavernas de Prontera vivem cheias de gente da cidade e de fora. Fica bem movimentado."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#54 (mes)
- "[Cuskoal]"
+ "[Cuskoal]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#55 (mes)
- "It's a pretty good place to stop by for general information and to listen to rumors."
+ "É um bom lugar para colher informação geral e ouvir boatos."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#56 (mes)
- "[Cuskoal]"
+ "[Cuskoal]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#57 (mes)
- "So if you listen carefully, you just might get lucky and learn some very useful information for yourself."
+ "Então, se prestar atenção, pode ter sorte e aprender alguma coisa bem útil."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#58 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#59 (mes)
- "Mt. Mjornir, located north of Prontera, is a tough"
+ "O Monte Mjolnir, ao norte de Prontera, é uma escalada"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#60 (mes)
- "and steep climb."
+ "e a subida é íngreme."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#61 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#62 (mes)
- "Aside from the dangers of the mountain itself, insanely vicious insects live there too. I mean, they'll just attack you for no reason."
+ "Além dos perigos da própria montanha, vivem ali insetos absurdamente violentos. Eles atacam sem motivo nenhum."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#63 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#64 (mes)
- "If you ever want to visit somewhere past Mt. Mjolnir, then you prepare yourself for the challenge.  Or you could walk around it."
+ "Se quiser ir a algum lugar além do Monte Mjolnir, prepare-se para o desafio. Ou dê a volta por fora."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#65 (mes)
- "Some monsters in the world have the unique ability to sense mystical energy, and can detect Magic spells before they are cast."
+ "Alguns monstros têm a capacidade de sentir energia mística e detectam magias antes de serem conjuradas."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#66 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#67 (mes)
- "Golem of the desert is one of them. Don't underestimate it due to its sluggishness..."
+ "O Golem do deserto é um deles. Não o subestime por ser lento..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#68 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#69 (mes)
- "If you try to cast magic near it, it will notice and saunter over to smash you. So you better watch out for Golem."
+ "Se você tentar conjurar magia perto dele, ele percebe e vem devagar te esmagar. Então cuidado com o Golem."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#70 (mes)
- "There's a very delightful place where you can find every"
+ "Existe um lugar delicioso onde se encontra todo"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#71 (mes)
- "type of Poring."
+ "tipo de Poring."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#72 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#73 (mes)
- "It's somewhere near the bridge connecting the forest and the desert, on the way to the city of Payon which is Southeast from here."
+ "Fica perto da ponte que liga a floresta ao deserto, no caminho para Payon, a sudeste daqui."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#74 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#75 (mes)
- "There are not only pink Porings but also Drops, which can be found at the desert, and the green Poporing."
+ "Não existem só os Porings rosa: há também os Drops, do deserto, e o Poporing verde."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#76 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#77 (mes)
- "But be careful, before you realize it, you may come face to face with Ghostring, a deadly Poring that floats around in the air like a ghost."
+ "Mas cuidado: sem perceber você pode dar de cara com o Ghostring, um Poring mortal que flutua no ar como um fantasma."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#78 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#79 (mes)
- "Well, of course, they are all very cute, but Ghostring is an EXCEPTION. It is very very dangerous."
+ "Claro que todos são fofinhos, mas o Ghostring é EXCEÇÃO. Ele é muito, muito perigoso."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#80 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#81 (mes)
- "If you are lucky enough, you might even bump into Angeling, the Poring with Angel wings."
+ "Com sorte, você pode até esbarrar no Angeling, o Poring com asas de anjo."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#82 (select)
- "Ghostring?:Angeling?:End Conversation."
+ "Ghostring?:Angeling?:Encerrar conversa."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#83 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#84 (mes)
- "Ghostring is a grayish Poring that floats around in the air like a ghost. Just like other ghosts, physical attacks can't do any damage to it."
+ "O Ghostring é um Poring acinzentado que flutua no ar como um fantasma. Como todo fantasma, ataque físico não causa dano nele."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#85 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#86 (mes)
- "Those whose main attack methods are physical like Swordman and Archer might have to run for their lives when facing Ghostrings."
+ "Quem ataca fisicamente, como Espadachim e Arqueiro, talvez tenha que correr por sua vida ao encontrar um Ghostring."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#87 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#88 (mes)
- "But don't leave just yet~! There is great news for people with those jobs. Making a weapon of some elemental property is the key."
+ "Mas não vá embora ainda~! Há uma boa notícia para essas classes. A chave é conseguir uma arma com propriedade elemental."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#89 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#90 (mes)
