- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#95 (mes)
- "If you've got an extra knife or sword, you could give it a shot. But it will be very difficult alone, don't you think?"
+ "Se tiver uma faca ou espada sobrando, pode tentar. Mas sozinho vai ser bem difícil, não acha?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#96 (mes)
- "[Dega]"
+ "[Dega]"
