+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#99 (mes)
- "I was thinking, even though the people of Izlude live so close to the ocean..."
+ "Eu estava pensando: mesmo o povo de Izlude vivendo tão perto do mar..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#100 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#101 (mes)
- "There are other cultures that have completely developed by living off of the sea. Of course, I'm talking about Amatsu."
+ "Existem culturas que se desenvolveram inteiramente vivendo do mar. Falo de Amatsu, claro."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#102 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#103 (mes)
- "I hear the cuisine there is really good! Although the idea of eating raw fish is new to me, I would love to go there, and try it just once!"
+ "Dizem que a comida de lá é ótima! A ideia de comer peixe cru é nova para mim, mas eu adoraria ir lá provar pelo menos uma vez!"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#104 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#105 (mes)
- "Don't you think Binoculars"
+ "Você não acha que binóculos"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#106 (mes)
- "are really COOL?! You can"
+ "são MUITO legais?! Dá para"
