- "see all sorts of places...!"
+ "ver todo tipo de lugar...!"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#108 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#109 (mes)
- "Here in Izlude, we are responsible for maintaining peace not only on land but also at sea. That's why this city has a huge telescope."
+ "Aqui em Izlude somos responsáveis pela paz não só em terra, mas também no mar. Por isso a cidade tem um telescópio enorme."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#110 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#111 (mes)
- "This telescope constantly watches over the sea, so that we can prevent any serious trouble from happening. You know..."
+ "Este telescópio vigia o mar o tempo todo, para evitarmos qualquer problema sério. Você sabe..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#112 (mes)
- "[Kylick]"
+ "[Kylick]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#113 (mes)
- "An ounce of"
+ "É melhor"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#114 (mes)
- "prevention is worth"
+ "prevenir"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#115 (mes)
- "a pound of cure"
+ "do que remediar"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#116 (mes)
- "after all, right?"
+ "no fim das contas, né?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#117 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#118 (mes)
- "The only skill that's needed for a Swordman is ^FF2400Bash^000000! Bash, Bash and ONLY ^FF2400Bash^000000! No need to waste time and effort for smaller skills! Everything else is for cowards and wusses!"
+ "A única habilidade que um Espadachim precisa é ^FF2400Golpe Fulminante^000000! Golpe, Golpe e SÓ ^FF2400Golpe Fulminante^000000! Não perca tempo com habilidade menor! O resto é para covarde e banana!"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#119 (mes)
- "[Cebalis]"
+ "[Cebalis]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#120 (mes)
- "What are you talking about!? The ideal Swordman resolutely stands alone, surrounded by countless enemies and smashing them all with one awesome attack."
+ "Do que você está falando!? O Espadachim ideal enfrenta sozinho incontáveis inimigos e esmaga todos com um golpe formidável."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#121 (mes)
- "[Cebalis]"
+ "[Cebalis]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#122 (mes)
- "^EE0000MAGNUM BREAK!^000000"
+ "^EE0000IMPACTO EXPLOSIVO!^000000"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#123 (mes)
- "That's right, Magnum Break"
+ "Isso mesmo, Impacto Explosivo"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#124 (mes)
- "is the skill that does"
