#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#137 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#138 (mes)
- "Oh man~"
+ "Rapaz~"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#139 (mes)
- "Hey, I know you just"
+ "Ei, eu sei que você acabou de"
