- "heard everything."
+ "ouvi tudo."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#141 (mes)
- "So what do you think?"
+ "Então, o que você acha?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#142 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#143 (mes)
- "Which one do you think is better? The critical damage skill, ^FF2400Bash^000000, or the Splash damage skill, ^EE0000Magnum Break^000000?"
+ "Qual você acha melhor? O golpe de dano crítico, ^FF2400Golpe Fulminante^000000, ou o de dano em área, ^EE0000Impacto Explosivo^000000?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#144 (select)
- "Bash:Magnum Break"
+ "Golpe Fulminante:Impacto Explosivo"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#145 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#146 (mes)
- "Hahahaha!!! I knew you'd see things my way!! You ARE a great guy!! Undoubtedly, only ^FF2400Bash^000000 suits a Swordman. Please tell that to this BONEHEAD over here~ Hahaha!"
+ "Hahahaha!!! Eu sabia que você ia concordar!! Você É gente boa!! Sem dúvida, só ^FF2400Golpe Fulminante^000000 serve a um Espadachim. Explica isso pra essa CABEÇA-DE-VENTO aqui~ Hahaha!"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#147 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#148 (mes)
- "Hmm, let me give you a bit of advice. After you achieve level 5 'Bash', the amount of SP consumed by the skill increases greatly, so watch out for your SP."
+ "Hmm, um conselho: depois do nível 5 de 'Golpe Fulminante', o consumo de SP sobe muito, então fique de olho no seu SP."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#149 (mes)
- "[Red]"
+ "[Red]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#150 (mes)
- "Hahahaha!! See!? Someone who pursues a different job agrees with me~! You really are a great guy! Hahaha!! Undoubtedly, only ^FF2400Bash^000000 suits a Swordman. Please tell that to this NIMROD over here~ Hahaha!"
+ "Hahahaha!! Viu!? Alguém de outra classe concorda comigo~! Você é gente boa mesmo! Hahaha!! Sem dúvida, só ^FF2400Golpe Fulminante^000000 serve a um Espadachim. Explica isso pra esse PATETA aqui~ Hahaha!"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#151 (mes)
- "[Cebalis]"
+ "[Cebalis]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#152 (mes)
- "Alright!! ^EE0000Magnum Break^000000 is the BEST!! Now you're talking~!! You know the stuff~ HaHaHa!"
+ "Isso aí!! ^EE0000Impacto Explosivo^000000 é O MELHOR!! Agora sim~!! Você manja~ HaHaHa!"
