#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#211 (mes)
- "HeHeHeHe..HaHaHaHa "
+ "Hehehehe..Hahahaha "
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#212 (mes)
- "Huh? Why am I so happy?"
+ "Hã? Por que estou tão feliz?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#213 (mes)
- "You wanna know?"
+ "Quer saber?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#214 (select)
- "Sure, why?:Not really, I don't care."
+ "Claro, por quê?:Nem tanto, tanto faz."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#215 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#216 (mes)
- "Ah~~ There's not much for us to do these days. You see, Merchants buy items dropped by monsters. But you knew that, right? "
+ "Ah~~ Não temos muito o que fazer hoje em dia. Sabe, os Mercadores compram os itens que os monstros deixam cair. Mas isso você já sabia, né? "
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#217 (select)
- "Of course:Eh? Really?"
+ "Claro:Ãh? Sério?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#218 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#219 (mes)
- "HaHa~ In fact, that was actually part of our job. But there were more and more hunters who came to us in order to get paid and it became too much to handle."
+ "Haha~ Na verdade isso já foi parte do nosso trabalho. Mas vinha cada vez mais caçador querendo receber, e virou coisa demais."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#220 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#221 (mes)
- "We had to work overtime every day. Ah, it was a nightmare...! Anyway, the government eventually made a wise decision in creating the Registration System."
+ "Fazíamos hora extra todo dia. Ah, era um pesadelo...! Enfim, o governo acabou tomando uma decisão sábia ao criar o Sistema de Registro."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#222 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#223 (mes)
- "The Office of Prize Compensation only pays those who have the Registration. Of course, you'd have to be a merchant and stay in the same place all day long."
+ "A Central de Compensação só paga quem tem o Registro. Claro que para isso você teria que ser mercador e ficar o dia todo no mesmo lugar."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#224 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#225 (mes)
- "The Office gives away the registration to any merchant who fulfills those requirements. So nowadays, the hunters sell their goods to the registered merchants."
+ "A Central concede o registro a qualquer mercador que cumpra esses requisitos. Por isso hoje os caçadores vendem aos mercadores registrados."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#226 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#227 (mes)
- "So nowadays, the hunters sell their goods to the registered merchants.  Not too many people come to us for that anymore."
+ "Por isso hoje os caçadores vendem aos mercadores registrados. Já não vem muita gente até nós para isso."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#228 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#229 (mes)
- "I mean we are still busy, but that's nothing compared to how it was before. People who have felt suffering know how to appreciate even the slightest comfort."
+ "Ainda temos movimento, mas não é nada perto de antes. Quem já sofreu sabe dar valor até ao menor conforto."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#230 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#231 (mes)
- "What?! What do you mean you didn't know?! Well, you know you can get items by killing monsters. If you bring and sell those to a merchant, you can make some money. "
+ "O quê?! Como assim não sabia?! Bom, você consegue itens matando monstros. Vendendo esses itens a um mercador, dá para ganhar dinheiro. "
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#232 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
