#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#244 (mes)
- "[Soldier]"
+ "[Soldado]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#245 (mes)
- "Okay Good Bye~~"
+ "Certo, até mais~~"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#246 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#247 (mes)
- "Don't you think Strong VIT and training in a unique breathing method which enables quick HP recovery are the greatest advantages for a Swordman?"
+ "Não acha que VIT alta e um treino de respiração que acelera a recuperação de HP são as maiores vantagens de um Espadachim?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#248 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#249 (mes)
- "If you train your skills very hard, you can even see your HP recovering. The amount"
+ "Treinando muito, dá até para ver o HP se recuperando. O quanto"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#250 (mes)
- "recovered depends"
+ "se recupera depende"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#251 (mes)
- "vitality, or VIT."
+ "da vitalidade, a VIT."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#252 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#253 (mes)
- "So if you invest more of your stats in VIT, you'll recover more HP overall when resting."
+ "Então, quanto mais atributos você põe em VIT, mais HP recupera ao descansar."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#254 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#255 (mes)
- "But of course, it'd be good to have high Attack, wouldn't it? You can either acquire a good weapon or bring up your STR to support you Attack."
+ "E claro, é bom ter Ataque alto, não é? Você pode conseguir uma arma boa ou subir a FOR para reforçar o Ataque."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#256 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#257 (mes)
- "You know you'll need some strength anyway to swing good weapons easily, anyway."
+ "De todo modo, você vai precisar de força para brandir armas boas com facilidade."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#258 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#259 (mes)
- "Another important thing is how accurate you can hit your opponents. DEX is the key here. If you train DEX, then the gap between the MIN and MAX damage will also decrease."
+ "Outra coisa importante é a precisão dos seus golpes. A chave é a DES. Treinando DES, a diferença entre o dano mínimo e o máximo também diminui."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#260 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#261 (mes)
- "Hm..."
+ "Hm..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#262 (mes)
- "Are you bored by all this talk? Or do you want me to go on?"
+ "Já enjoou dessa conversa? Ou quer que eu continue?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#263 (select)
- "Tell me more please.:End conversation."
+ "Conte mais, por favor.:Encerrar conversa."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#264 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#265 (mes)
- "Hmm..."
+ "Hmm..."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#266 (mes)
- "In that case, I'll explain about the other attributes to you briefly. In order to attack and evade quickly, you've gotta pay attention to AGI. "
+ "Nesse caso, explico rapidamente os outros atributos. Para atacar e esquivar rápido, você tem que cuidar da AGI. "
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#267 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#268 (mes)
- "In case you want to make more critical hits, it's a good idea to invest in LUK. INT also increases Max SP, which is needed to use various skills... But it's really up to you."
+ "Se quiser causar mais críticos, vale investir em SOR. A INT também aumenta o SP máximo, necessário para várias habilidades... mas a escolha é sua."
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#269 (mes)
- "[Aaron]"
+ "[Aaron]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#270 (mes)
- "Okay then,"
+ "Certo, então"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#271 (mes)
- "train hard~~"
+ "treine forte~~"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#272 (mes)
- "[Sailor]"
+ "[Marinheiro]"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#273 (mes)
- "Wanna"
+ "Quer"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#274 (mes)
- "head back?"
+ "voltar?"
#: npc/cities/izlude.txt#275 (select)
- "Yeah, I'm tired to death.:Nope, I love this place!"
+ "Sim, estou morto de cansaço.:Não, adoro este lugar!"

